1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
An IDX research morning can mean checking filings, suspensions, movers, news, foreign flow, and corporate actions one by one.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
MarketOps ID turns those disconnected signals into one research queue.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:24,000
It uses Sectors Financial API v2 for discovery, then selectively enriches the strongest tickers with related evidence.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Evidence is correlated by ticker and ranked with an explainable Research Attention Score. A high score means review first - never buy or sell.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Persistent event fingerprints suppress repeats. In the verified sanitized replay, the first run found 16 new events; the identical second run suppressed all 16.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:57,000
A GitHub Actions weekday schedule is configured for the live workflow. Live API, webhook, and genuine scheduled-run evidence are pending account setup.
